{
  "author": "Portal Suite",
  "content": "<section style=\"margin:0 0 22px;padding:18px 16px;border-left:5px solid #C9A227;background:#F7F3E8\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;color:#7A5B12;font-size:14px;font-weight:700\">Portal Suite</p><p style=\"margin:0;color:#142033;font-size:21px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.4\">摩根大通：HDD出货容量同比增29%，磁头出货量增19%</p></section>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">Techno Systems Research在8月12日发布了<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2026年</span>二季度HDD出货数据。<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">JPM</span>电子元件行业报告随即更新了产业链观察，核心信号很直接：HDD出货量只增长了<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">9%</span>，但出货容量同比增加了<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">29%</span>，单台平均容量从13TB左右抬升到15.3TB。容量增长远快于数量增长，说明这轮周期不是简单补库存，而是单台价值量在系统性上升。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">报告把目光集中在HDD组件环节，尤其是磁头。二季度HDD磁头出货量<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">4.15亿</span>个，同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">19%</span>，单台HDD磁头数从11.5个增加到12.6个，近线HDD单台磁头数已经接近20个。磁头出货增速明显高于整机增速，背后是近线HDD占比提升和单台磁头数增加两个因素叠加。<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">JPM</span>在电子元件板块中的重点关注标的是TDK，理由是TDK从<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2026年</span><span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">一季度</span>开始向两家自产磁头的硬盘厂商供货，<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">二季度</span>供应量继续扩大。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOX7sq5LeXicAicoB4JZjQ8o2oJbqz4eRd4l3icAcuoGLeG9crYrp1s1LKpLziaPx40DfPeVX6Ae550yPas1lQwzH53mQxqEfVo4icUc/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 1\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">1. 近线HDD出货占比过半，单台容量与单价同步抬升</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">二季度HDD总出货量<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">3300万</span>台，其中近线HDD出货<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">1910万</span>台，同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">16%</span>，占总出货量比重接近<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">58%</span>。近线HDD出货金额<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">69.12亿美元</span>，同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">49%</span>，占HDD总出货金额的<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">87%</span>。这个结构变化直接推高了行业平均单价——HDD整体平均单价240.4美元，同比上涨35%；近线HDD平均单价362.8美元，同比上涨29%。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">出货容量504EB，同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">29%</span>，单台平均容量15.3TB，同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">18%</span>。每GB单价0.0157美元，同比上涨<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">14%</span>。近线HDD每GB成本约0.014美元，与NAND闪存的每GB成本差距扩大到<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">19.2倍</span>，创下历史新高。去年同期这个差距只有<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">4.8倍</span>，今年<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">一季度</span>是<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">12倍</span>，一个季度内又跳升了7倍以上。</p>\n<blockquote style=\"margin:16px 0;padding:10px 14px;border-left:3px solid #AAB4C3;background:#F7F8FA;color:#4B5565;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75\"><strong>KC观察：</strong> 先看NAND与近线HDD的每GB成本差距从<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">4.8倍</span>扩大到<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">19.2倍</span>这个数字，它说明AI数据中心对存储容量的需求正在把两种存储技术的价差拉到极端水平。简单说，闪存越贵，近线HDD在大容量冷数据存储场景里的性价比优势就越突出；我更关注的是这个价差能否持续维持，因为它直接决定云厂商下一轮存储采购会把多少预算分配给HDD。</blockquote>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOVia6h1RDG7kVVBbjyibibC1rHiaHYwSsUruR4BhpuRMVOGmpQdbKUib4AUYKW0eM7liaqcNO3LEaZCqxHlZ2pQO8YbbMXUENiaGtL2CQ/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 2\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">2. 磁头出货增速快于整机，单台磁头数上升是核心驱动</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">二季度HDD磁头（HGA）出货量<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">4.15亿</span>个，同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">19%</span>，环比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">3%</span>。单台HDD磁头数从去年同期的11.5个增加到12.6个，近线HDD单台磁头数从18.6个增加到19.8个。磁头出货增速比整机出货增速高出10个百分点，说明每台HDD里装的磁头数量在增加，而不是单纯靠整机数量拉动。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">TDK二季度磁头出货<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">6060万</span>个，同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">34%</span>，环比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">15%</span>，市场份额从去年<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">二季度</span>的<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">13.0%</span>提升到<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">14.6%</span>。报告特别指出，TDK从<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">一季度</span>开始向两家自产磁头的厂商供货，二季度供应量继续扩大。这两家厂商原本是自产自用，现在开始外购，意味着HDD磁头的供应链格局正在发生变化。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOXsy6BFlPcFIBaW2mCOU8eaE2EhSFkBbA6TxtCflWnKQnUPNXkzmEJFiaZxeA9F8OpCJWu1b1Zqhwo2oQV6ibicbSLmeXl5WHBLib0/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 3\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<p style=\"margin:28px 0 0;padding-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #D9DEE7;color:#8A93A3;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6\">For informational purposes only. Portions may be generated, translated, summarized, or edited with AI assistance based on source materials and may contain omissions or errors. Please verify independently. This is not investment, legal, tax, accounting, or other professional advice.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOXFG9WuJspPndR1yF9GCSsSy9UX4QxqCyVreZZtewjhayjFOBbKKWNOgv0nwr6y9IFZxzvUzMKG8sJWuha81r122LHRdTYYsqo/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"Portal Suite\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;color:#A3ABB8;font-size:12px;line-height:1.55;text-align:left\">Original report: 27-JPM-Electronic Components Sector-Component Data Deposition- Trends in HDD shipments and major HDD components in Apr-Jun 2026-260814</p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;padding:14px 16px;background:#EAF2FB;border-left:4px solid #2E6FB7;color:#152033;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;font-weight:600\">更新信息参见portal.example.invalid</p>",
